WEBVTT

01:37.700 --> 01:44.000
Ketil's Farm

01:38.900 --> 01:43.120
Einar, Thorfinn... Starting today,
you two are friends.

01:47.630 --> 01:49.480
Go on, say hello.

01:49.480 --> 01:52.110
I'll be assigning the
two of you the same job.

01:52.110 --> 01:53.760
You're to work together.

01:55.170 --> 01:57.010
Nice to meet you, Thorfinn.

01:58.080 --> 01:58.900
Hello.

01:59.930 --> 02:03.460
Good. Let me explain what you'll be doing.

02:04.740 --> 02:07.850
Einar, what does this place look like to you?

02:07.850 --> 02:10.070
What? Uh...

02:11.070 --> 02:13.290
A forest?

02:13.890 --> 02:15.880
Wrong.

02:17.160 --> 02:21.080
This is a future wheat farm.

02:22.830 --> 02:25.790
I own these woods.

02:25.790 --> 02:28.200
I'm going to let the two of you borrow them.

02:28.860 --> 02:29.960
Borrow?

02:29.960 --> 02:33.050
Yes. I'll leave everything up to you.

02:33.050 --> 02:37.070
You'll clear this land, work it,
and reap the harvest.

02:37.070 --> 02:39.720
I'll buy it from you for a fair price.

02:40.400 --> 02:45.600
Once that amount exceeds your price,
you'll buy yourselves back.

02:48.010 --> 02:49.710
Buy ourselves?

02:49.710 --> 02:53.900
In other words, we'll... we'll be free?

02:54.170 --> 02:59.660
That's right. Earn your freedom
yourselves, the right way.

03:00.310 --> 03:05.510
Depending on how hard you work, you may be
able to accomplish that within three years.

03:06.060 --> 03:09.330
I'll wait to collect your lease payment
until after your first harvest.

03:11.330 --> 03:14.090
What's the matter? Is there a problem?

03:15.990 --> 03:19.550
N-No. Thank you. I'll do my best.

03:21.250 --> 03:22.310
Good.

03:22.620 --> 03:27.390
If you have any problems
or questions, ask Pater here.

03:27.390 --> 03:29.940
He knows this farm well.

03:29.940 --> 03:31.710
Nice to meet you.

03:31.710 --> 03:35.160
I became a free man by the same means.

03:35.160 --> 03:38.450
I know it'll be tough working in an
unfamiliar land, but do your best.

03:38.450 --> 03:39.990
I w-will!

03:41.210 --> 03:44.450
For today, observe Thorfinn's work.

03:44.890 --> 03:47.270
You must be exhausted from the long journey.

03:49.830 --> 03:54.650
Thorfinn, be good to Einar. Got it?

03:54.650 --> 03:55.530
Yes, sir.

04:03.390 --> 04:05.420
Hey, our master...

04:05.420 --> 04:06.230
Huh?

04:08.560 --> 04:10.580
Hey, wait up.

04:12.160 --> 04:15.480
What kind of man is our master?

04:20.240 --> 04:22.600
Is this normal in Denmark?

04:23.020 --> 04:28.470
We had slaves back in my homeland,
but they were slaves for life.

04:32.990 --> 04:37.320
I'm from Northern England. What about you?

04:40.770 --> 04:42.040
Iceland.

04:43.180 --> 04:45.600
Iceland, huh?

04:47.100 --> 04:48.460
Iceland...

04:49.830 --> 04:50.730
Where's that?

04:52.640 --> 04:56.690
Wow, you've already cut down a ton of trees.

04:57.240 --> 04:58.690
How much is left?

05:01.590 --> 05:03.350
Everything on this side.

05:03.890 --> 05:05.110
This side?

05:08.230 --> 05:10.160
See that river over there?

05:10.490 --> 05:12.850
Everything on this side of the river.

05:13.580 --> 05:17.620
This side of the river?

05:20.470 --> 05:22.100
You mean...

05:24.350 --> 05:27.560
There's still a lot left to clear?

05:46.070 --> 05:47.610
Huh? What?

05:48.420 --> 05:49.370
Hup!

05:53.930 --> 05:54.470
Huh?

05:57.520 --> 05:58.980
What do you want?

05:59.430 --> 06:02.130
He told you to observe.

06:03.270 --> 06:06.170
I want to free myself as soon as possible.

06:06.170 --> 06:07.390
What's wrong with that?

06:09.310 --> 06:12.660
In that case, could you
work a little farther away?

06:13.080 --> 06:16.650
And cut them so they fall
perpendicular to the river.

06:17.630 --> 06:21.210
I see. So we float them down the river, huh?

06:26.800 --> 06:28.490
Ow...

06:29.230 --> 06:31.740
Man, I'm hungry.

06:31.740 --> 06:34.540
Hey, how does lunch work around here?

06:36.510 --> 06:37.590
We get lunch.

06:39.710 --> 06:43.800
That's good. Do we go pick it up somewhere?

06:43.800 --> 06:46.940
No, the retainers should be bringing it soon.

06:46.940 --> 06:50.810
Really? This place leaves
nothing to be desired.

06:52.030 --> 06:53.680
No way. Seriously?

06:53.680 --> 06:54.940
Seriously.

06:54.940 --> 06:57.810
Hey, lunch is here. Right, Thorfinn?

07:01.570 --> 07:03.340
I'm telling you, seriously.

07:03.340 --> 07:05.070
You're the only one who hasn't.

07:05.370 --> 07:07.570
Man, I had no idea.

07:07.570 --> 07:09.950
I guess I'll go see her tonight.

07:09.950 --> 07:11.670
Yeah, you should.

07:11.670 --> 07:13.150
Go and get rejected.

07:13.150 --> 07:14.460
That's not gonna happen.

07:16.170 --> 07:18.710
Hey, that must be the newbie.

07:18.710 --> 07:21.000
Yeah, looks like it.

07:21.670 --> 07:22.840
Look at that stupid face.

07:22.840 --> 07:24.550
The face of a slave.

07:24.860 --> 07:26.600
H-Hello, I...

07:26.600 --> 07:29.320
Yeah, we know. We've heard.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.810
Um...

07:33.070 --> 07:35.070
What is this?

07:35.070 --> 07:37.320
Your lunch.

07:40.730 --> 07:43.230
Let's all go tonight.

07:43.230 --> 07:45.730
Um, what is this?

07:46.950 --> 07:48.610
I said it's your lunch.

07:48.610 --> 07:49.570
What?

07:50.450 --> 07:53.450
Th-This is all?

07:53.450 --> 07:56.960
What? You got a problem with that, huh?

07:56.960 --> 07:59.460
Not a problem, exactly...

08:00.130 --> 08:02.490
This is for both of us?

08:04.850 --> 08:06.190
You heard him.

08:06.190 --> 08:07.930
Good grief.

08:07.930 --> 08:11.290
Is this your first time being a slave?

08:11.290 --> 08:14.060
What? Well, yes.

08:14.390 --> 08:16.470
Then remember this.

08:16.470 --> 08:18.440
You're lucky you're getting fed at all.

08:18.440 --> 08:22.610
Not only that, but us free men came
all the way here to bring you lunch.

08:23.180 --> 08:26.070
You should start by thanking us.

08:28.360 --> 08:29.970
These jerks...

08:30.820 --> 08:32.820
Go on, say it.

08:32.820 --> 08:36.080
Say, "Thank you."

08:39.330 --> 08:43.250
Why are you looking at me like that, asshole?

08:45.960 --> 08:50.100
We'll take it. Thank you.

08:58.640 --> 09:01.730
Thorfinn, you'd better
teach him some manners.

09:02.920 --> 09:05.800
And don't injure the horse.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.450
Yes, sir.

09:17.390 --> 09:19.750
Those assholes are napping.

09:20.340 --> 09:23.720
They just came here to shirk their duties.

09:24.850 --> 09:29.770
And you shouldn't be so obedient
just because you're a slave.

09:32.220 --> 09:34.850
Einar, push from the back.

09:35.240 --> 09:36.740
I'll pull from the front.

09:40.990 --> 09:43.600
Once we get it to the river,
we'll use it to build a raft.

09:44.450 --> 09:48.040
Shouldn't we cut this tree a little shorter?

09:48.040 --> 09:50.740
That old horse won't be able
to drag it by itself.

09:51.080 --> 09:52.900
The trees belong to our master.

09:53.300 --> 09:55.350
We can't cut them shorter
without his permission.

09:56.430 --> 10:00.430
Hey, isn't this their job?

10:00.430 --> 10:03.080
Normally you wouldn't let
a slave use a horse.

10:03.400 --> 10:06.060
And this miserable horse alone
won't be enough.

10:06.060 --> 10:07.590
Don't worry about it. Let's go.

10:18.100 --> 10:19.160
Einar.

10:19.160 --> 10:20.350
O-Okay!

10:30.910 --> 10:33.240
Einar, lift the front.

10:34.030 --> 10:35.220
Got it.

10:45.110 --> 10:46.050
Let's go.

11:10.480 --> 11:12.870
I'm so hungry, I feel sick.

11:14.790 --> 11:18.290
They won't get away with this.

11:18.730 --> 11:20.890
They ate my lunch.

11:22.270 --> 11:29.130
Retainers don't have their own farms,
so they have to serve a master, right?

11:29.630 --> 11:30.880
Yeah.

11:32.550 --> 11:37.400
Then they're halfway
to being slaves themselves.

11:37.400 --> 11:41.890
They're just making sure there's
someone beneath them by bullying us.

11:45.470 --> 11:48.270
Don't you agree, Thorfinn?

11:49.990 --> 11:54.310
I don't know. It doesn't matter.

11:57.190 --> 11:59.790
It does matter.

11:59.790 --> 12:02.590
We're our master's property.

12:02.590 --> 12:06.120
His retainers can't push us around.

12:06.120 --> 12:08.020
I'm going to tell our master about this.

12:08.930 --> 12:12.810
Don't. They'll just harass us more.

12:15.910 --> 12:19.110
And you're okay with that?

12:23.650 --> 12:25.890
Einar, Thorfinn...

12:26.580 --> 12:28.100
Master.

12:29.390 --> 12:34.020
Well, Einar? How was your first day?

12:34.020 --> 12:36.010
Actually, I have something to report.

12:36.010 --> 12:36.970
Don't.

12:36.970 --> 12:37.780
Shut up.

12:38.270 --> 12:41.050
I have something to report.

12:41.050 --> 12:45.020
Today, those retainers of yours...

13:02.420 --> 13:05.320
What is it, Einar?
What do you have to report?

13:07.950 --> 13:09.830
What a strange fellow.

13:09.830 --> 13:12.170
If you've got nothing to say,
then I'm leaving.

13:34.340 --> 13:35.240
Einar.

13:35.840 --> 13:36.650
Huh?

13:37.910 --> 13:39.510
Weren't you going to report them?

13:45.460 --> 13:46.580
Shut up.

14:09.190 --> 14:10.750
Hup.

14:15.540 --> 14:17.430
It's hot today.

14:17.430 --> 14:19.090
We've got water.

14:20.380 --> 14:23.020
We just got it from the spring.

14:23.020 --> 14:24.510
It's cold.

14:24.860 --> 14:26.680
Bring me a cup.

14:27.350 --> 14:29.000
High-speed turn!

14:32.520 --> 14:34.010
Here you go.

14:34.010 --> 14:35.400
Thank you.

14:35.400 --> 14:37.650
We went to the deep spring.

14:39.990 --> 14:42.780
I feel rejuvenated. Thank you.

14:43.760 --> 14:45.160
You're welcome.

14:46.510 --> 14:47.870
Come on, everyone.

14:48.190 --> 14:50.220
We're almost done.

14:50.220 --> 14:52.410
Let's finish this patch by noon.

14:52.410 --> 14:53.620
Yes, sir.

14:55.990 --> 14:58.790
The master's pitching in, too, huh?

14:58.790 --> 15:02.070
I thought rich people didn't work.

15:05.600 --> 15:11.270
Danish or English, we all look
the same when we're working.

15:16.130 --> 15:18.480
Hey, not like that.

15:18.480 --> 15:20.980
Don't make me say it again, Olmar.

15:20.980 --> 15:24.740
What? I'm just doing what you told me to do.

15:24.740 --> 15:26.490
Use a hand sickle.

15:26.490 --> 15:30.110
And cut it to below the knee.

15:30.110 --> 15:31.780
I showed you how to do this.

15:32.510 --> 15:35.030
Who cares as long as it gets cut?

15:35.030 --> 15:35.500
What?

15:35.500 --> 15:38.920
You fool. After the harvest
comes the grazing.

15:38.920 --> 15:43.630
We leave long stumps so
the livestock can eat them.

15:43.630 --> 15:48.520
You're 17, and you still haven't
learned the order of things.

15:48.520 --> 15:52.280
That's why you don't understand
the purpose of each individual task.

15:53.030 --> 15:55.960
Shut up. I know.

15:55.960 --> 15:57.890
I've got the order down pat.

15:59.020 --> 16:01.750
Get this into that thick skull.

16:01.750 --> 16:04.150
If you're going to lead others, then—

16:04.150 --> 16:06.440
Yeah, yeah. Below the knee, right?

16:06.870 --> 16:09.080
I got it.

16:09.080 --> 16:09.990
Whoa!

16:09.990 --> 16:12.830
You fool! Don't swing your scythe like that.

16:12.830 --> 16:15.250
You'll crush the ears of the wheat.

16:15.250 --> 16:16.750
You said cut below the knee.

16:16.130 --> 16:19.690
What's going on over there?
He's getting an earful.

16:16.750 --> 16:17.670
I'm doing that.

16:17.670 --> 16:19.430
Do it properly.

16:19.690 --> 16:21.840
That's the master's son, Olmar.

16:20.660 --> 16:23.050
Right there. Just like that.

16:21.840 --> 16:24.130
Father and son, huh?

16:23.050 --> 16:24.130
Shut up.

16:25.030 --> 16:27.220
Ah, I can't take this!

16:27.810 --> 16:32.350
I thought I'd help out for once, and you
won't stop complaining about stupid shit.

16:32.350 --> 16:36.710
I'm out. I thought I'd help, but forget it.

16:36.710 --> 16:39.640
Hey, where are you going, Olmar?

16:39.980 --> 16:42.730
Somewhere you ain't, shithead.

16:42.730 --> 16:45.710
You'll be taking over this farm before long.

16:45.710 --> 16:47.530
You need to accept that.

16:47.800 --> 16:51.690
When did I say I wanted
to take over this place?

16:51.690 --> 16:59.250
A grown man shouldn't be doing
this dull, boring, tedious farm work!

16:59.250 --> 17:01.330
I'm gonna use this to...

17:05.300 --> 17:06.180
Huh?

17:09.840 --> 17:12.010
What's he doing?

17:12.010 --> 17:12.540
What?

17:12.540 --> 17:13.770
I'm not sure.

17:23.440 --> 17:28.210
I'm gonna make a name for myself
with a sword, damn it!

17:25.490 --> 17:28.870
Olmar! Wait, boy!

17:33.310 --> 17:37.580
I'm going to England soon.
I'll make sure of it.

17:40.800 --> 17:44.040
I'm not spending my whole life here
in the middle of nowhere.

17:44.470 --> 17:49.490
I'm gonna join Prince Canute's army
and achieve greatness.

18:06.690 --> 18:11.320
Um... Sir, when is soon?

18:12.110 --> 18:14.200
Soon means soon.

18:14.490 --> 18:18.280
King Harald should be calling
for reinforcements soon.

18:19.240 --> 18:23.460
I think you should take over the farm.

18:23.460 --> 18:26.040
What? You, too?

18:26.040 --> 18:27.630
What do you know?

18:27.630 --> 18:29.510
That's not what I meant.

18:29.510 --> 18:33.010
I'm just worried about you.

18:34.370 --> 18:36.680
Huh? Oh...

18:40.390 --> 18:41.270
Hey...

18:42.550 --> 18:45.300
Come here. Let's go again.

18:47.330 --> 18:51.290
Good, daughter of mine. That's it.

18:51.290 --> 18:52.680
How are things going?

18:53.310 --> 18:55.480
I brought food for the young master.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.530
What?

18:57.700 --> 19:00.990
N-Not now. They're getting round two started.

19:00.990 --> 19:02.150
Oh, my!

19:03.600 --> 19:04.750
Oh, my.

19:08.150 --> 19:11.470
With this, our family's future
will be secure.

19:11.470 --> 19:16.470
Exactly. As long as the young master
keeps coming here...

19:26.150 --> 19:28.440
Wh-Wh-Wh-What's the matter, sir?

19:28.440 --> 19:30.690
Did our daughter commit some kind of blunder?

19:31.490 --> 19:33.610
Shut up, idiots!

19:33.610 --> 19:38.380
I know what you're up to,
you penniless tenant farmers.

19:38.380 --> 19:40.740
You're after my dad's fortune.

19:41.080 --> 19:44.500
You think you'll get to live a life of
luxury if you join Ketil's family?

19:44.500 --> 19:46.750
W-We'd never dream of that.

19:49.000 --> 19:51.910
Women are rotten, every last one of them!

19:51.910 --> 19:55.760
Sir, that wasn't our intention!

19:55.760 --> 19:58.010
Sir, wait!

19:58.930 --> 20:01.850
Damn it. What's wrong with everyone?

20:01.850 --> 20:04.890
I'm my own person, not my father's tagalong.

20:04.890 --> 20:07.930
Damn it! I feel like shit!

20:09.760 --> 20:11.720
Hey, it's the young master.

20:11.720 --> 20:13.930
Huh? The young master?

20:14.400 --> 20:16.620
Hello, sir!

20:16.620 --> 20:18.030
Hey!

20:20.650 --> 20:22.990
What are you doing?

20:22.990 --> 20:25.180
It's dangerous to race around at night.

20:25.180 --> 20:26.660
So dangerous.

20:27.430 --> 20:29.670
What are you guys doing?

20:29.670 --> 20:34.280
We're coming over to you.

20:34.280 --> 20:37.670
Come on. Walk straight.

20:38.500 --> 20:44.570
We went to see a woman,
but the retainers beat us to her.

20:44.570 --> 20:46.520
Hey, the wheat...

20:44.570 --> 20:47.160
So we're drowning our sorrows.

20:47.680 --> 20:53.070
But if we start a fight with them,
we'll get in trouble with our boss again.

20:53.070 --> 20:55.560
Screw that, right?

20:55.560 --> 20:58.190
Screw that.

20:58.190 --> 21:04.680
You're lucky. You can do
whatever you want on this farm.

21:04.680 --> 21:08.580
Shut up. You guys don't know how I feel.

21:08.580 --> 21:11.050
What? Are you mad?

21:11.050 --> 21:12.870
You got something on your mind?

21:12.870 --> 21:15.480
Don't be mad.

21:15.960 --> 21:19.340
I don't have time for you idiots.

21:19.790 --> 21:21.950
Go back to your fort and go to sleep.

21:21.950 --> 21:26.510
Now, now, now, now, now, now...
Don't be so irritable.

21:26.510 --> 21:27.690
You're young.

21:27.100 --> 21:28.970
But you're so cold.

21:28.970 --> 21:31.480
H-Hey, don't try to lead my horse.

21:31.480 --> 21:35.110
Don't worry about it.
Let's drink another round, okay?

21:35.420 --> 21:38.390
Let's stay up all night chatting, young master.

21:38.390 --> 21:40.610
Tell us all about your youthful troubles.

21:41.620 --> 21:44.950
You're hoping I'll entertain you
while you drink, aren't you?

21:44.950 --> 21:48.570
Screw this. I'm going home. Let go.

22:01.030 --> 22:04.010
He should just take over the farm.

22:04.740 --> 22:06.490
He doesn't know war.

22:07.710 --> 22:10.740
He probably thinks warriors are cool.

22:13.730 --> 22:17.540
Everyone who goes to war is a beast.

22:20.210 --> 22:23.150
Go to sleep. We have an early morning.

22:24.820 --> 22:30.100
Soldiers came to my village twice.

22:36.470 --> 22:41.090
First came the King of England's soldiers.
They burned down every single house.

22:42.640 --> 22:46.340
My dad fought against them, but he was killed.

22:48.070 --> 22:51.480
All I could do was watch.

22:58.510 --> 23:02.550
After them came the Danes.

23:07.460 --> 23:10.820
They claimed they were saving us
from the tyranny of the King of England,

23:11.750 --> 23:14.450
but they pillaged everything they could.

23:21.890 --> 23:27.930
They're beasts wearing human skin.

23:33.430 --> 23:37.620
Hey, Thorfinn. Are you asleep?

25:36.850 --> 25:40.020
Snake

25:38.270 --> 25:39.320
"Snake."
